      "widgets_values": [
        "# LTX 2.5 CuTe 3D neighborhood decode\nDerived from Comfy-Org workflow_templates `video_ltx2_5_t2v.json`, first stage only. 384x256, 33 frames, seed 1729, 8 distilled steps.\nInstall this extension and its CUDA dependencies. Use the diffusion video VAE (not the convolutional VAE). The CuTe decode node replaces only 3D neighborhood attention. Select `comfy` for comparison; `cute` is strict FP16/BF16 CUDA. Tiled decode is optional.\nModel downloads require access to Lightricks/LTX-2.5 on Hugging Face. See README for exact files and validation scope."
      ]
